{"sha": "bc76a530cbff86b11b9b1612668e7b4f4316d7274cc538ed2210faf1ca8b77f0", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:diffeq} 章 --- 微分方程}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:1}", "第一个矩阵：特征值 $1, 2$，特征向量 $(1,0)$ 与 $(1,1)$。", "将 $X_0 = (1,0) = 1\\cdot(1,0) + 0\\cdot(1,1)$ 分解，其解", "为", "\\[", "X(t) = \\eu^{t}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix} .", "\\]", "（初始向量本身就是特征向量。）", "", "第二个矩阵：$A = 2I + N$，$N = E_{12}$，$N^2 = 0$，$\\eu^{tA} =", "\\eu^{2t}(I + tN)$，故", "\\[", "X(t) = \\eu^{2t}\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & t\\\\ 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}", "\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\eu^{2t}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:2}", "$y' = \\sin(ty)$：$\\abs{\\sin(ty) - \\sin(tz)} \\leq \\abs t\\,\\abs{y -", "z}$ --- 关于 $y$ 在每一段时间上一致利普希茨：", "在 $\\R$ 上有唯一整体解（对每一段时间应用", "该定理）。", "", "$y' = y^2$：仅局部利普希茨，没有整体定理，事实上", "$y(0) = 1$ 的解在 $t = 1$ 处爆破。", "", "$y' = \\abs y$：$\\abs\\cdot$ 是 $1$-利普希茨的，整体存在性与", "唯一性成立。取 $y(0) = 0$：$y \\equiv 0$（由唯一性）。取 $y(0)", "= 1$ 时，$y$ 保持为正（不能穿过零解），于是 $y' =", "y$，$y = \\eu^t$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:3}", "若某时刻 $y(t_1) = z(t_1)$，则 $y$ 与 $z$ 满足同一个", "$t_1$ 处的柯西问题：由唯一性，$y = z$ 在它们的公共", "区间上成立 --- 不同的解永不相交。", "", "对 $y' = y(1-y)$，常数 $0$ 与 $1$ 是解。初值", "位于 $\\intoo{0}{1}$ 中的解永远不能到达 $0$ 或 $1$", "（否则将与常数解相碰）：它始终停留在", "$\\intoo{0}{1}$ 内，因而是整体的（有界，不发生爆破 --- 例如", "由\\cref{exo:b2:diffeq:9}的判别准则，或因向量场", "在被困的带形区域上有界）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:4}", "$(A - 2I)^2 = \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1\\\\ -1 & -1\\end{pmatrix}^2 = 0$：", "以 $D = 2I$，$N = A - 2I$ 作邓福德分解：", "\\[", "\\eu^{tA} = \\eu^{2t}\\,(I + tN)", "= \\eu^{2t}\\begin{pmatrix} 1 + t & t\\\\ -t & 1 - t\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "常数变易法，取 $B(s) = (\\eu^{2s}, 0)^{\\mathsf T}$：", "\\[", "X(t) = \\int_0^t \\eu^{(t-s)A}B(s)\\,\\dd s", "= \\eu^{2t}\\int_0^t \\begin{pmatrix} 1 + (t-s)\\\\ -(t-s)", "\\end{pmatrix}\\dd s", "= \\eu^{2t}\\begin{pmatrix} t + \\frac{t^2}{2}\\\\[2pt] -\\frac{t^2}{2}", "\\end{pmatrix},", "\\]", "利用 $\\eu^{(t-s)A}B(s) = \\eu^{2(t-s)}(I + (t-s)N)\\,(\\eu^{2s},", "0)^{\\mathsf T} = \\eu^{2t}\\bigl(1 + (t-s),\\, -(t-s)\\bigr)^{\\mathsf", "T}$。（验算：$X(0) = 0$；$X' - AX = (\\eu^{2t}, 0)^{\\mathsf T}$", "求导可得。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:5}", "\\emph{级数：} $A = \\alpha I + \\beta J$，其中 $J =", "\\begin{pmatrix}0 & -1\\\\ 1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}$，$J^2 = -I$；两个", "加项可交换，故 $\\eu^{tA} = \\eu^{\\alpha t}\\,\\eu^{\\beta tJ}$，", "且 $\\eu^{\\beta t J}$ 的级数按偶次与奇次幂分开，", "分别合并为 $\\cos(\\beta t)I + \\sin(\\beta t)J$：即所述的旋转伸缩", "矩阵。", "", "\\emph{复数形式：}将 $(x, y) \\in \\R^2$ 与 $z = x + \\iu y$ 等同；", "该系统 $X' = AX$ 写作 $z' = (\\alpha + \\iu\\beta)z$，其", "解 $z(t) = \\eu^{\\alpha t}\\eu^{\\iu\\beta t}z_0$ 恰为", "螺线：模为 $\\eu^{\\alpha t}$，辐角以速率", "$\\beta$ 增加。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:6}", "令 $v(t) = \\eu^{-k(t - t_0)}\\int_{t_0}^t u$。则", "\\[", "v'(t) = \\eu^{-k(t-t_0)}\\Bigl(u(t) - k\\int_{t_0}^t u\\Bigr)", "\\leq C\\,\\eu^{-k(t-t_0)},", "\\]", "由假设，从 $t_0$ 到 $t$ 积分（$v(t_0) = 0$）：", "$v(t) \\leq \\frac{C}{k}\\bigl(1 - \\eu^{-k(t - t_0)}\\bigr)$，即", "$k\\int_{t_0}^t u \\leq C\\bigl(\\eu^{k(t-t_0)} - 1\\bigr)$；代回", "假设得：$u(t) \\leq C\\eu^{k(t-t_0)}$。", "", "唯一性与依赖性：积分方程的两个解 $y, z$", "满足", "\\[", "\\norm{y(t) - z(t)} \\leq \\norm{y_0 - z_0} +", "k\\int_{t_0}^{t}\\norm{y - z},", "\\]", "由格朗沃尔不等式（取 $C = \\norm{y_0 - z_0}$）得指数", "型估计；取 $C = 0$ 即得唯一性。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:7}", "作代换 $y = y_1 z$，其中 $y_1 = \\frac{\\sin t}{t}$：由一般", "降阶公式（\\cref{prop:b2:diffeq:secondorder}）给出，对 $u", "= z'$，", "\\[", "y_1 u' + \\Bigl(2y_1' + \\frac{2}{t}\\,y_1\\Bigr)u = 0", "\\]", "（方程化为 $y'' + \\frac2t y' + y = 0$）。计算", "$2y_1' + \\frac2t y_1 = 2\\,\\frac{t\\cos t - \\sin t}{t^2} +", "\\frac{2\\sin t}{t^2} = \\frac{2\\cos t}{t}$：故", "\\[", "\\frac{u'}{u} = -\\frac{2\\cos t}{t}\\cdot\\frac{t}{\\sin t}", "= -2\\cot t", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "u = \\frac{1}{\\sin^2 t}", "\\quad (\\text{相差一个常数}),", "\\]", "从而 $z = -\\cot t$，得 $y_2 = y_1 z = -\\frac{\\cos t}{t}$。", "在 $\\intoo{0}{\\pi}$ 上的通解：", "\\[", "y(t) = \\alpha\\,\\frac{\\sin t}{t} + \\beta\\,\\frac{\\cos t}{t} .", "\\]", "（它们是零阶球贝塞尔函数。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}